        "status": "fixed",
        "hunk": ".github/actions/flutter-pub-get/action.yml:77-80 — inline block replaced by nested `- uses: ./.github/actions/sqlite3-native-assets-prewarm` with `package-roots: ${{ inputs.working-directory }}`; AC4 asserts the nested call. (Residual legacy copies in build-mobile.yml:211,484 and assert-builtin-skills are raised as a new suggestion, not a re-introduction of this finding's flutter-pub-get drift.)"
